,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTAwMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16100387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet","html_url":"https://github.com/larspet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-15T03:02:46Z","updated_at":"2024-12-15T03:02:46Z","body":"> Show in FileSystem does not work properly in split mode. You need to use it twice to show the file.\r\n\r\nFixed.\r\n\r\nAlso, I've noticed that every time `navigate_to_path()` is called, `_navigate_to_path()` will be called twice, because of the \"Filter Files\" search box being cleared with `file_list_search_box->clear()` and thus invoking `_search_changed()`.\r\n\r\nThis would be simple enough to fix in the case when it's already empty and doesn't need to be cleared, but in the other case it's a little more involved. Since this is also kind of a separate issue, it's probably better handled in a separate PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2543425177/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2543932406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100336#issuecomment-2543932406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100336","id":2543932406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XoVP2","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-15T16:11:01Z","updated_at":"2024-12-15T16:11:01Z","body":"> _navigate_to_path() will be called twice, because of the \"Filter Files\" search box being cleared with file_list_search_box->clear() and thus invoking _search_changed().\r\n\r\nSounds like #100275 will fix it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2543932406/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2543972187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100336#issuecomment-2543972187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100336","id":2543972187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Xoe9b","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MD